Independent same-model NATIVE image review of real intermediate GLB renders. No tools, shell, file edits, or internet. First confirm images visibly accessible. Images pairs in order: new hall, new bakery/workcourt, new forge. Give per-building concrete visible architecture defects or sensible provisional acceptance: roof closure, unsupported beams, excessive boxiness, readable craft purpose, open entrances. These are design-stage images, not final gate, not live-world/locomotion proof, not Bill approval. Do not invent unseen interiors or certify collision. 350 words maximum.
